 (v4, 清理后干净重提交)（准备中）\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v4: 0% dosage 0.5B s42 baseline eval (v4, 清理后干净重提交)（准备中）\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v2（准备中）\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v3: 100% dosage 0.5B s42 contaminated model evaluation (v3, 修复版 evaluate.py) — 上界 contamination score inflation（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 3 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned_v4** (success): —\\\\n- **exp_001_sft_d025_15B** (success): 25% dosage contaminated SFT on Qwen2.5-1.5B (seed=42): mid-dosage contamination for 1.5B dose-response curve intermediate point\\\\n- **exp_001_eval_3B_d005_aligned** (success): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 39 / 负向 0 / 失败 16 / 共 57\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ncqa1-21977: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_15B_d000_s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_100pct_05B: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d005_05B: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d100_15B: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_004_sim_sweep: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_005_noise_prop: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_005_noise_prop_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d025_05B: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_sft_d025_05B_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_006_irt_05B: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_001_eval_05B_d100_aligned_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_006_irt_05B_v1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3019, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WjGgFnKYdC1t8wueh5cHM2","session_id":"49fcde5e-0610-4e7e-a894-56110a3c51ee","uuid":"5431039e-37df-439f-9864-1d739da46c88","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:24:38.769Z"}
